    "title": "Ontario man killed in Grant County crash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Corryn Brock ,\n9 hours ago\nGRANT COUNTY, Ind. (WPTA) - A 60-year-old Ontario man was killed in a Grant County crash Thursday. Lee Lauzon was travelling southbound on I-69 near the 269 mile-marker at about 6 a.m. when the Freightliner semi he was driving went off the road and rolled. Lauzon died at the scene.\nRead full article\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
